 "context": "<div data-type=\"note\" data-has-label=\"true\" id=\"fs-idp140338803634624\" class=\"interactive-embedded-reading\" data-label=\"\">\n<div data-type=\"title\">Link to Learning</div>\n    <span data-type=\"media\" id=\"fs-idp140338803635408\" data-alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\">\n        <img src=\"https://openstax.org/apps/archive/20240910.161227/resources/512810e97f7e7d4a8d42fc7502e501c1fd4d057b\" data-media-type=\"image/png\" alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\">\n    </span>\n<p id=\"fs-idp140338797982624\">Watch this visual animation to see the spatial arrangement of the p and s orbitals.\n</p>\n<div data-type=\"media\" id=\"eip-id5846277\" data-alt=\"orbitals\">\n<div class=\"os-has-iframe os-has-link\" data-type=\"switch\">\n<a class=\"os-is-link\" href=\"https://openstax.org/books/biology/pages/2-1-atoms-isotopes-ions-and-molecules-the-building-blocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" data-media=\"print\">Access multimedia content</a>\n<iframe width=\"660\" height=\"371.4\" src=\"https://www.openstaxcollege.org/l/orbitals\" class=\"os-is-iframe\" data-media=\"screen\"><!-- no-selfclose --></iframe>\n</div>\n                 </div>\n</div>",
